WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:01.128
- Yo, how'd your date go?

00:00:01.128 --> 00:00:03.171
- It went great man,
thanks. I really like her.

00:00:03.171 --> 00:00:03.588
- Nice.

00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:04.422
- Yeah.

00:00:04.422 --> 00:00:09.422
(suspenseful dubstep)

00:00:09.595 --> 00:00:12.113
(gasp)

00:00:12.143 --> 00:00:15.883
(suspense music)

00:00:17.813 --> 00:00:19.018
- Don't worry guys, she probably

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:21.064
doesn't even know how it works.

00:00:23.754 --> 00:00:26.690
- Oh my, look at all these pictures.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.114
- I just shut down the
Wi-Fi for two city blocks.

00:00:29.114 --> 00:00:30.156
She's offline.

00:00:30.156 --> 00:00:31.613
- No, no, no, she just liked one of my

00:00:31.613 --> 00:00:33.078
status updates from two years ago.

00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:34.744
- That's impossible. There's a signal

00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:36.204
coming from inside the building.

00:00:36.204 --> 00:00:37.956
She's inside the building!

00:00:37.956 --> 00:00:39.332
(dial-up connecting)

00:00:39.332 --> 00:00:41.126
- This thing is so slow.

00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:42.710
- What do I even do?

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:46.751
- Ooh, so that's how you upload a picture.

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:49.301
- I just saw your baby junk man (laughs)

00:00:51.931 --> 00:00:53.347
- Where are you?

00:00:53.347 --> 00:00:56.183
- Stop tagging me in all of your posts.

00:00:56.183 --> 00:00:59.477
- I saw your post. I
just want you to be safe.

00:00:59.477 --> 00:01:01.604
That's why I'm giving you condoms.

00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:04.274
- I can't help you anymore.

00:01:04.274 --> 00:01:04.939
- Why not?

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.734
- She told my mom to add me too.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:10.031
(whispers) Now they're
gonna friend all of us.

00:01:10.031 --> 00:01:11.489
- Let us in.

00:01:11.489 --> 00:01:13.033
- My mom just friended me on Facebook.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:14.367
- My mom just added me on Facebook.

00:01:16.057 --> 00:01:18.558
- My mom added me too!

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:23.369
- Finally, I blocked her. It's over.

00:01:23.369 --> 00:01:24.544
(phone buzzes)

00:01:24.544 --> 00:01:25.212
- Hi honey.

00:01:25.212 --> 00:01:26.338
- Hey babe, what's up?

00:01:26.338 --> 00:01:27.589
- I just wanted to tell
you about something

00:01:27.589 --> 00:01:29.418
really sweet that happened.

00:01:29.418 --> 00:01:31.301
Your mom added me on Facebook,

00:01:31.301 --> 00:01:32.468
isn't that great?

00:01:33.558 --> 00:01:38.479
- No!

00:01:40.869 --> 00:01:43.804
(heart beating)

